<title>POLAND: Polish shares close flat in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares close flat in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>BIG and Elektrim closed flat in Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Tuesday in a turnover of 73,000 zlotys, down from 79,800 zlotys on Monday.</p>
<p>BPH, Debica and Rolimpex did not trade.</p>
<p>Polish mass privatisation NFI units were flat at 95.5 zlotys in a turnover of 1.1 million zlotys, down from Monday's 1.3 million zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
